{{Quote|This is Pad Two, Pad Two, I spot forty Rebels heading west on Pad Two.|[[Bodhi Rook]]|<ref name="Rogue One" />}}
'''Pad Two''' was the second landing pad at the [[Imperial Center of Military Research]] on [[Scarif]]. During the [[Battle of Scarif]], [[Bodhi Rook]] created confusion by falsely reporting to the [[Citadel Tower]] that he spotted forty [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebels]] heading west on Pad Two.<ref name="Rogue One" />

